What to do with this number:
  AUROC >= 0.85  -> strong baseline; the heuristic + classifier alone
                    is defendable; CNN training is an upgrade, not a
                    prerequisite. Phase 2 is optional.
  AUROC ~ 0.70   -> reasonable but not great; CNN training likely
                    helps; consider Phase 2 if you have cluster time.
  AUROC <= 0.55  -> near chance; the math pipeline + heuristic does
                    not separate this dataset; revisit assumptions
                    before committing to CNN training.
